=== Ket luan ===
- movement_type=REVERSAL  : di qua CHECK, chi dung lai o foreign key vi database rieng
                            chua co du lieu tham chieu => CHECK CHAP NHAN gia tri canonical.
- movement_type=ADJUST_IN : bi chan boi chinh chk_stock_movement_type_current, TRUOC ca
                            foreign key => PostgreSQL TU CHOI sua ton truc tiep.
- Ca hai insert nam trong transaction va da ROLLBACK, khong ghi du lieu.

=> Khong ton tai duong ghi ton thu hai o tang DB, doc lap voi tang route/permission.
